{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16447","headline":"胡笳十八拍 第八拍 · 刘商","name":"胡笳十八拍 第八拍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忆昔私家恣娇小，远取珍禽学驯扰。\n如今沦弃念故乡，悔不当初放林表。\n朔风萧萧寒日暮，星河寥落胡天晓。\n旦夕思归不得归，愁心想似笼中鸟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘商","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16447.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16447","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}